      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, many vendor modules are used by vendor apexes without setting apex_available. I\u0027m afraid this change breaks them. FYI, we haven\u0027t enforced \"apex_available\" for vendor apexes because, unlike system-side apexes, vendor apexes are mostly specific to products/companies/...\n\nIIUC, setting `apex_available:[\"//apex_available:platform\"]` is not the same as \"not setting\". Probably preventing libs from being embedded in apexes.\n\nCan you check if this won\u0027t break vendor modules?",
